      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Singapore is a country that requires travelers to submit a Singapore Arrival Card (SGAC) for health and travel declaration upon arrival.&lt;SEP&gt;Singapore is a country and city-state that is the destination for the traveler and the host of the Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority.&lt;SEP&gt;The country and city where the arrival is taking place, as specified in the declaration.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-601e22b4f94edabf2237fab6cbfd4023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4037d38d08f22ec8826d69685fe00bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647fd8f28e5eabdb226f2c330b2a3f4</data>
