    <node id="Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority">
      <data key="d0">Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority (ICA) is the Singapore government agency responsible for processing the Singapore Arrival Card (SGAC) and managing immigration and checkpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;The Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority (ICA) is the government agency responsible for processing arrival cards and immigration checks in Singapore.&lt;SEP&gt;The Singapore government agency responsible for immigration and checkpoints, which received the Singapore Arrival Card submission.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-601e22b4f94edabf2237fab6cbfd4023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4037d38d08f22ec8826d69685fe00bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647fd8f28e5eabdb226f2c330b2a3f4</data>
