    <node id="Singapore Arrival Card">
      <data key="d0">Singapore Arrival Card</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Singapore Arrival Card (SGAC) is a mandatory health and travel declaration form required for travelers entering Singapore, submitted prior to arrival.&lt;SEP&gt;The Singapore Arrival Card (SGAC) is a mandatory health and travel declaration form for travelers entering Singapore.&lt;SEP&gt;A document required for travelers to declare health and travel information upon arrival in Singapore.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-601e22b4f94edabf2237fab6cbfd4023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4037d38d08f22ec8826d69685fe00bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647fd8f28e5eabdb226f2c330b2a3f4</data>
