      <data key="d2">The Pan Pacific Hotel Singapore is the accommodation address provided by Zhu Haotian for his stay in Singapore.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pan Pacific Hotel Singapore is a hotel in Singapore serving as the accommodation address for the traveler Zhu Weiyi.&lt;SEP&gt;The accommodation address provided by the submitter for their stay in Singapore.</data>
