    <node id="Infectious Diseases Act">
      <data key="d0">Infectious Diseases Act</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Infectious Diseases Act is a Singapore law that governs health declarations and imposes penalties for false or misleading health declarations, including fines or imprisonment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Infectious Diseases Act is a Singapore law governing health declarations and referenced for penalties related to false declarations.&lt;SEP&gt;A Singapore law that imposes penalties for false health declarations related to infectious diseases.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-601e22b4f94edabf2237fab6cbfd4023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4037d38d08f22ec8826d69685fe00bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5647fd8f28e5eabdb226f2c330b2a3f4</data>
