      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Automated Clearance Initiative is a service provided by ICA that allows eligible travelers to use automated lanes upon arrival in Singapore, subject to entry requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Automated Clearance Initiative is a program by the Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority allowing eligible travelers to use automated lanes upon arrival in Singapore.&lt;SEP&gt;A program by the Immigration &amp; Checkpoints Authority allowing eligible travelers to use automated lanes upon arrival in Singapore.</data>
