      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Misuse of Drugs Act is a Singapore law that criminalizes drug offenses, including trafficking punishable by death.&lt;SEP&gt;The Misuse of Drugs Act is a Singapore law that prohibits unauthorised consumption, possession, import, export, and trafficking of controlled drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;A Singapore law that criminalizes the unauthorised consumption, possession, import, export, and trafficking of controlled drugs.</data>
